---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Childcare Solutions | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Explore Marietta Childcare's solution-based approach to childcare, tailored to meet the unique needs of every family.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/parent_dropoff_hug_doorway_background.jpg" 
        alt="Childcare solutions" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Childcare Solutions for Every Family</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Solution-based approach to childcare tailored to meet the unique needs of every family.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Understanding Your Family's Needs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare understands that families face different childcare challenges. Working parents at Marietta Childcare need reliable, flexible care. Single parents at Marietta Childcare benefit from affordable, supportive services. New parents at Marietta Childcare require guidance and developmental information.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's solution-based approach matches services to family needs. Marietta Childcare recognizes that families with special needs children require specialized support. Marietta Childcare's solutions address budget constraints, scheduling flexibility, and enrichment interests.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Comprehensive Service Options</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers comprehensive services addressing various family situations. Marietta Childcare provides full-time care for working parents. Marietta Childcare's flexible scheduling accommodates non-traditional work hours.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's programs include infant care, toddler programs, preschool, and school-age care. Marietta Childcare offers summer camp, before and after school care, and specialized programs. Marietta Childcare's diverse offerings ensure families find appropriate solutions.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Personalized Approach</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare takes a personalized approach to each family's situation. Marietta Childcare's enrollment advisors discuss family needs and circumstances. Marietta Childcare develops customized solutions addressing specific challenges.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff works with families to identify the best program fit. Marietta Childcare's flexible policies accommodate changing family needs. Marietta Childcare's commitment to personalization ensures families feel supported.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Solutions by Family Type</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides targeted solutions for different family types. Solutions at Marietta Childcare for working parents include full-time care and flexible scheduling. Marietta Childcare's solutions for single parents emphasize affordability and support.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers specialized support for new parents navigating early parenthood. Solutions at Marietta Childcare for families with special needs children include inclusive programming. Marietta Childcare's multilingual family support serves diverse communities.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Financial Solutions</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare recognizes that childcare costs are a significant family expense. Financial solutions at Marietta Childcare include flexible payment options. Marietta Childcare accepts childcare subsidy vouchers and tuition assistance programs.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers affordable childcare options for budget-conscious families. Marietta Childcare's payment plans accommodate various family budgets. Marietta Childcare's financial solutions make quality childcare accessible.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Enrichment and Development</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides enrichment solutions for families seeking advanced programming. Premium enrichment programs at Marietta Childcare include STEM learning, music, arts, and sports. Marietta Childcare's enrichment offerings support children's diverse interests and talents.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's curriculum supports developmental growth across all domains. Marietta Childcare's enrichment approach prepares children for academic success. Marietta Childcare's programs balance structured learning with play-based discovery.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Transition and Support Services</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides transition support for children moving between programs. Transition services at Marietta Childcare help children adjust to new environments. Marietta Childcare's kindergarten readiness program prepares children for school entry.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's transition support extends to families navigating life changes. Marietta Childcare provides resources and guidance during transitions. Marietta Childcare's support services ensure smooth transitions for all children.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Find Your Solution</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to discuss their unique needs and find the right solution. Contact Marietta Childcare today to explore how Marietta Childcare can serve your family.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Contact Us</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Explore Solutions</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/solutions/working-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Solutions for Working Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/single-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Support for Single Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/new-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">First-Time Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/special-needs-children" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Special Needs Support</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/budget-conscious" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Affordable Childcare Options</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
